  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan reaches contact heart river bank, a Chi clan resource point, and finds a large number of wisdom path contact heart Gu on the bank before he plunders them.",
        "chapters": [
          1589
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_chi_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wild contact heart Gu gather in the air like a colored cloud as he draws them into his immortal aperture. He estimates more than three thousand rank five, fifty thousand rank four, and over a million rank three and below. The defending Gu Immortal flees without destroying the stock, which is why the haul is so large. Contact heart river bank is a special area dense with wisdom path dao marks; earth, water, wood, and other dao marks are present as foundation but fewer than wisdom path.",
        "chapters": [
          1590
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "plunder-counts",
